{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Savor the taste of pulling off the win with the <strong>Umami </strong>bundle, serving up a delicious fusion of flavor and firepower, and bring a mouth-watering ramen-inspired vibe to your guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve up your weaponry with the soupy, noodle-forward look of this tasty bundle. Drag your opponents through the soup in every match\u2014from that satisfying first slurp, to that thrilling final shot! These skins feature brothy muzzle flashes, slurping boiling gun sounds, and rich savory designs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This bundle includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deluxe Pistol &quot;Umami&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deluxe Shock Pistol &quot;Umami&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deluxe Burst Rifle &quot;Umami&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deluxe Shotgun &quot;Umami&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deluxe SMG &quot;Umami&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deluxe Rocket Launcher &quot;Umami&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This bundle contains add-on content in the form of in-game items, and requires the base free-to-play app Hyper Dash. (Sold Separately)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557850?t=1742474391","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557850?t=1742474391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557850/1546d7ac6065c3f516ec5a6bc7bd6c640be1edaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742474391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557850/1546d7ac6065c3f516ec5a6bc7bd6c640be1edaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742474391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player